\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"continue\",\n        \"pause\",\n        \"explained\",\n        \"obligation\"\n      ],\n      \"title\": \"Action\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"candidate_id\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"default\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Candidate Id\"\n    },\n    \"parent_candidate_id\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"default\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Parent Candidate Id\"\n    },\n    \"question\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/AuditQuestion\"\n    },\n    \"resume_conditions\": {\n      \"default\": [],\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"title\": \"Resume Conditions\",\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    },\n    \"result_implications\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"default\": {},\n      \"propertyNames\": {\n        \"enum\": [\n          \"holds\",\n          \"violated\",\n          \"incomplete\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"title\": \"Result Implications\",\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"obligation\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ClaimDraft\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"default\": null\n    },\n    \"bindings\": {\n      \"default\": [],\n      \"items\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/BindingDraft\"\n      },\n      \"title\": \"Bindings\",\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"rationale\",\n    \"action\",\n    \"question\"\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"CandidateSubmission\",\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The caller trace confirms that contexts identify pending read batches: a follower reconstructs the context from the reply, then uses it for an exact lookup. The queue’s existing test also expects coalesced reads to retain their individual contexts. This supports a request-correlation suspicion, but it does not yet establish an executed failure or a linearizability violation. I’ll save that question with the core map and its remaining schedule and contract gaps."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > build_submission.py <<'PY'\nimport json\nsources=[]\ndef src(id,file,a,b,kind='code_observation'):\n sources.append(dict(id=id,file=file,start_line=a,end_line=b,kind=kind));return id\nsrc('s-quorum','internal/raft/raft.go',374,429)\nsrc('s-commit','internal/raft/raft.go',815,929)\nsrc('s-authority','internal/raft/raft.go',931,1135)\nsrc('s-dispatch','internal/raft/raft.go',1393,1564)\nsrc('s-replication','internal/raft/raft.go',1316,1391)\nsrc('s-leader','internal/raft/raft.go',1603,1790)\nsrc('s-readqueue','internal/raft/readindex.go',21,116)\nsrc('s-readtest','internal/raft/readindex_test.go',125,164,'test_expectation')\nsrc('s-follower','internal/raft/raft.go',1906,1985)\nsrc('s-routing','internal/raft/raft.go',2029,2164)\nsrc('s-membership','internal/raft/raft.go',1137,1310)\nsrc('s-log','internal/raft/logentry.go',290,399)\nsrc('s-restore','internal/raft/raft.go',237,292)\nsrc('s-snapshot','internal/raft/raft.go',437,526)\nsrc('s-tick','internal/raft/raft.go',559,630)\nsrc('s-send','internal/raft/raft.go',649,667)\nsrc('s-engine','engine.go',1289,1337)\nsrc('s-node-update','node.go',987,1115)\nsrc('s-node-step','node.go',1118,1167)\nsrc('s-node-read','node.go',1225,1233)\nsrc('s-client-read','request.go',842,957)\nsrc('s-api-read','nodehost.go',855,866,'interface_statement')\nsrc('s-apply','node.go',238,280)\nsrc('s-rsm-config','internal/rsm/statemachine.go',960,975)\nsrc('s-rsm-recover','internal/rsm/statemachine.go',243,260)\nsrc('s-peer','internal/raft/peer.go',282,311)\nB=[]\ndef beh(id,activity,owner,context,trigger,ss,**kw):\n b=dict(id=id,primary_activity=activity,execution_owner=owner,protocol_context=context,trigger=trigger,source_ids=ss);b.update(kw);B.append(b)\nbeh('b-replicate','A1','raft leader/follower, serialized by node.raftMu','cluster, term, log index and voting membership','Proposal, Replicate or ReplicateResp', ['s-commit','s-replication','s-leader','s-quorum','s-routing','s-log','s-node-step'],implementation_guards=['Leader rejects proposals while transferring; only one pending configuration entry is admitted.','Follower checks predecessor term; committed conflicts panic.','Response wrapper requires a known remote, observer or witness; Handle rejects stale nonzero terms.','Commit counting includes remotes and witnesses, excludes observers, and requires the candidate index to have the current term.'],writes=['Append assigns current term and consecutive indexes; self match advances.','Successful follower reply updates remote match; rejected stale replies do not lower established match.','tryCommit advances committed index monotonically.'],external_effects=['Replication and commit propagation are queued; successful advancement broadcasts replication.'],async_boundaries=['Message production is separate from persistence and network delivery.'],produces_fact_ids=['f-commit'],cross_activity_effects={'A5':'Committed entries become eligible for application.','A2':'Election log freshness and a new leader current-term no-op constrain future advancement.'})\nbeh('b-authority','A2','raft state machine','node role, term, vote and leader identity','Election ticks, vote requests/responses, higher-term messages, quorum checks or transfer', ['s-authority','s-dispatch','s-follower','s-tick','s-routing'],implementation_guards=['Vote grant checks prior vote and log freshness. Election is withheld while committed entries remain unapplied.','Observers and witnesses do not campaign. Vote responses from observers are excluded.','CheckQuorum can demote a leader; higher terms reset context except the documented recent-leader vote suppression branch.'],writes=['New candidate increments term and votes for self; vote responses are deduplicated by sender.','Reset clears vote aggregation, pending readIndex, transfer and peer progress; vote itself clears only on term change.','Leadership appends a current-term no-op and reconstructs the uncommitted configuration-change flag.'],external_effects=['Campaign sends vote requests to current voting members; caught-up transfer target receives TimeoutNow.','Old nonzero-term messages are ignored; candidates drop proposals and reads; followers forward only when a leader is known.'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-commit'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Freshly reset replication and read support must be acquired in the new authority context.'})\nbeh('b-read-confirm','A1','leader raft.readIndex','pending SystemCtx queue within current leader context','ReadIndex admission and matching HeartbeatResp', ['s-readqueue','s-leader','s-commit','s-routing'],implementation_guards=['Multi-voter admission requires a committed entry in current term.','Duplicate context is not re-added; acknowledgements deduplicate sender; count plus local leader must reach quorum.','Heartbeat responses require a known remote/observer/witness and pass term dispatch.'],writes=['Queue records committed index, originating node, context and confirmed senders.','Confirming a context removes its queue prefix and rewrites each returned index to the confirmed request index while preserving each stored from and ctx.'],important_branches=['Single-voter requests bypass the confirmation queue and publish current commit.','Local completed statuses use s.ctx; forwarded completed statuses use s.from for destination but the triggering m.Hint/m.HintHigh for context.'],external_effects=['Local ReadyToRead records or remote ReadIndexResp messages are emitted for returned statuses.'],produces_fact_ids=['f-confirmed-read'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-commit'],cross_activity_effects={'A2':'Heartbeat confirmation supplies leadership support for the queued reads.','A7':'Forwarded result context is the identity consumed by the requester.'},unknowns=['Whether batching multiple forwarded reads loses earlier identity in a complete legal message history; local and single-status paths are counterevidence to a universal failure.'])\nbeh('b-read-receive','A1','follower or observer raft handler','ReadIndexResp message in accepted term','Forwarded response dispatch', ['s-follower','s-peer'],writes=['Follower reconstructs SystemCtx from message hints, records leader availability and publishes ReadyToRead(index, ctx).'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-confirmed-read'],external_effects=['Peer.GetUpdate exports ready records and Commit clears processed output.'],cross_activity_effects={'A7':'The emitted context controls which local request batch receives the result.'})\nbeh('b-read-client','A7','node pendingReadIndex under its mutex','local request batches keyed by SystemCtx','Incoming reads, ReadyToRead update, application notification, timeout collection or close', ['s-node-read','s-client-read','s-node-update','s-apply','s-api-read'],writes=['Each dequeued batch obtains a generated nonzero-low context and is registered before Peer.ReadIndex.','addReady changes only the exactly matching batch index.','applied notifies completed only for positive index <= applied and unexpired deadline, then removes that batch; timeout collection handles expired requests.'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-confirmed-read'],external_effects=['RequestState outcome notifies caller, which may read local state after successful completion.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Consumption of confirmed support is gated on local application, not merely receipt.'},unknowns=['No numeric successful-read deadline is inferred from the API timeout; a context-loss witness should target local correlation rather than assert unbounded liveness.'])\nbeh('b-membership','A4','RSM application and node raftMu','committed configuration entry and current membership','RSM configChange -> node.ApplyConfigChange -> peer -> raft membership handler', ['s-rsm-config','s-apply','s-membership','s-dispatch'],writes=['RSM validates change and marks applied; accepted changes update raft and registry.','Promotion inherits observer progress; removal deletes participant tracking and demotes a removed leader.'],implementation_guards=['Leader pending-config flag serializes admission; election guard prevents campaigning with committed unapplied entries.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Voting membership determines match-count quorum.','A2':'Eligibility and self-removal constrain leadership.'},unknowns=['Detailed membership validation and ordered-change rejection contracts remain unread.'])\nbeh('b-history','A6','engine persistence pipeline and entryLog','per-cluster Update and durable State/log','Node step produces Update; engine saves and commits processing', ['s-engine','s-node-update','s-log','s-restore','s-peer'],durable_effects=['SaveRaftState receives updates before normal queued responses are sent.'],important_branches=['Free-order replication messages can be sent before SaveRaftState; read readiness and drop notifications also precede it.','Entry log never appends over committed history; committed index only advances.'],writes=['Commit records processed output and clears messages/read readiness.','newRaft loads durable term/vote/commit and membership and starts without a known leader.'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-commit'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Persistence precedes normal acknowledgement publication in this engine path.','A2':'Durable term/vote and log freshness constrain recovered participation.'},unknowns=['Storage backend atomicity, full fast-apply ordering and crash windows remain outside the current source trace.'])\nbeh('b-recovery','A3','raft snapshot handling and RSM recovery','snapshot index/term/membership','InstallSnapshot or recovery task', ['s-snapshot','s-replication','s-log','s-rsm-recover'],implementation_guards=['Snapshots at or below committed are ignored; a matching log term advances commit without replacing history.'],writes=['Accepted replacement snapshot sets log committed/processed to snapshot index.','RSM recovery calls RestoreRemotes after recovering state; peer tracking is reconstructed from membership.'],p