knowledged context, and carries the latter status index after enough distinct recorded confirmations plus local leader are counted.',identity={'context':'readStatus.ctx / SystemCtx','origin':'readStatus.from'},validity_context='Multi-voter leader readIndex queue in its current authority context; confirm input must name a pending context. This fact describes returned status data, not correct forwarding or completed application.',representation=['readStatus{index, from, ctx, confirmed}','readIndex.pending and queue'],invalidators=['b-authority'],durability='Volatile; no pending read status is persisted.',recovery='Reset constructs an empty readIndex; caller timeout/completion tracking is separate.',source_ids=['s-readqueue','s-authority','s-leader','s-readtest'],unknowns=['Whether the remote reply encoder preserves each returned status identity for coalesced requests.'])]\nroles=json.load(open('../research.json'))['activity_roles']\nacts=[]\nfor a in roles:\n bs=[b for b in B if b['primary_activity']==a]\n acts.append(dict(class_id=a,applicability='applicable',purpose=roles[a]['relation'],realization_summary=' '.join(b['trigger']+'.' for b in bs),entry_points=[b['execution_owner'] for b in bs],source_ids=list(dict.fromkeys(x for b in bs for x in b['source_ids']))))\ndef path(ex,bs,fs,ss):return dict(explanation=ex,behavior_ids=bs,fact_ids=fs,source_ids=ss)\nm=dict(version=1,target_profile=dict(system_boundary='Captured Dragonboat Go implementation, including internal raft, node/engine, RSM and client request tracking. This initial map traces representative paths, not exhaustive coverage.',protocol_contexts=['Raft cluster and node identities; term and role; log index/term; voting versus observer/witness membership; read SystemCtx'],external_interfaces=['NodeHost.ReadIndex and RequestState completion','Peer message/update interface','LogDB persistence and RSM application callbacks'],ownership=['node.raftMu serializes raft stepping and configuration application; pendingR